problem:
Problem description
- There is a single-stage worker-to-task assignment problem with worker set $$W$$ and task set $$T$$.
- The worker pool contains more workers than the task set, so one worker will remain unassigned in the final plan.
- The planning horizon is a single decision stage denoted by $$H$$.
- The input data are the processing-time matrix $$P = [p_{ij}]$$, where $$p_{ij}$$ is the number of working hours required for worker $$i \in W$$ to complete task $$j \in T$$.
- Each worker has capacity $$c_i$$ for at most one task, and each task has demand $$r_j$$ for exactly one worker.
- The planning goal is to choose the worker-to-task assignment that covers every task and minimizes the total working hours.
- A solution is represented by:
  - $$X$$: a binary assignment matrix, where entry $$x_{ij}$$ indicates whether worker $$i$$ is assigned to task $$j$$.
  - $$k$$: the index of the worker left unassigned.
  - $$Z$$: the total working-hours value of the chosen assignment.

Input Format
{
  "num_workers": {
    "symbol": "$$M$$",
    "type": "integer",
    "meaning": "number of workers"
  },
  "num_tasks": {
    "symbol": "$$N$$",
    "type": "integer",
    "meaning": "number of tasks"
  },
  "planning_horizon": {
    "symbol": "$$H$$",
    "type": "integer",
    "meaning": "single-stage planning horizon"
  },
  "processing_hours": {
    "symbol": "$$P$$",
    "type": "matrix",
    "shape": "$$M \\times N$$",
    "meaning": "$$P_{ij}$$ is the working hours required for worker $$i$$ to complete task $$j$$"
  }
}

Output Format
{
  "assignment_matrix": {
    "symbol": "$$X$$",
    "type": "matrix",
    "shape": "$$M \\times N$$",
    "meaning": "entry $$x_{ij}$$ is $$1$$ if worker $$i$$ is assigned to task $$j$$, otherwise $$0$$"
  },
  "idle_worker": {
    "symbol": "$$k$$",
    "type": "scalar",
    "meaning": "the worker index that is left unassigned"
  },
  "total_working_hours": {
    "symbol": "$$Z$$",
    "type": "scalar",
    "meaning": "the total hours of the returned assignment"
  }
}

Example(s)

Input 1
{
  "workers": ["I", "II", "III", "IV", "V"],
  "tasks": ["A", "B", "C", "D"],
  "processing_hours": {
    "I": {"A": 9, "B": 4, "C": 3, "D": 7},
    "II": {"A": 4, "B": 6, "C": 5, "D": 6},
    "III": {"A": 5, "B": 4, "C": 7, "D": 5},
    "IV": {"A": 7, "B": 5, "C": 2, "D": 3},
    "V": {"A": 10, "B": 6, "C": 7, "D": 4}
  }
}
